cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or cite this book, please cite it as below."
type: book
title: "The Working Draft: Writing and Data Visualisation for Health Researchers"
abstract: >-
  A field guide to scientific writing, data visualisation, and reproducible
  research for health researchers. Part I covers the architecture and craft of
  the journal article; Part II covers the decisions behind a figure worth
  looking at; Part III covers reporting a clinical prediction model and making
  code and data reproducible. Written for doctoral students in clinical
  research and health data science, and for medical undergraduates. Every
  dataset, cohort, and effect estimate in the book is simulated.
